## Rust libraries

### rkyv
- **URL:** https://github.com/rkyv/rkyv
- **License:** MIT
- **Role:** Zero-copy serialization format for the `.dmap` binary archive.

### memmap2
- **URL:** https://github.com/RazrFalcon/memmap2-rs
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** Memory-mapped file access in the `dicom-map` library.

### PyO3
- **URL:** https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** Rust–Python bindings in `dicom-map-py`.

### maturin
- **URL:** https://github.com/PyO3/maturin
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** Build system for building and publishing Python wheels from the
  PyO3 crate.

### clap
- **URL:** https://github.com/clap-rs/clap
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** CLI argument parsing in `dmap-compile` and `dicom-lookup`.

### serde / serde_json
- **URL:** https://github.com/serde-rs/serde
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** JSON deserialization in the compiler pipeline.

### anyhow / thiserror
- **URL:** https://github.com/dtolnay/anyhow, https://github.com/dtolnay/thiserror
- **License:** MIT / Apache-2.0
- **Role:** Error handling throughout the Rust codebase.

### csv
- **URL:** https://github.com/BurntSushi/rust-csv
- **License:** MIT / Unlicense
- **Role:** CSV reading and writing in the compiler.

